resources.string_upd:
{email_header}
<h1 class="bx-email-title" style="margin:0 0 20px 0; font:600 28px/1.3 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.084px; color:#14171e; text-align:center;">Здравствуйте, {profile_name}</h1>
<p class="bx-email-text" style="margin:0 auto 16px auto; max-width:480px; font:400 16px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.048px; color:#43454b; text-align:center; word-break:break-word;">Вам подарили <b>{amount}</b> кредитов.</p>
<p class="bx-email-text" style="margin:0 auto 0 auto; max-width:480px; font:400 16px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.048px; color:#43454b; text-align:center; word-break:break-word;">{message}</p>
{email_footer}

{email_header}
<h1 class="bx-email-title" style="margin:0 0 20px 0; font:600 28px/1.3 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.084px; color:#14171e; text-align:center;">Здравствуйте, {profile_name}</h1>
<p class="bx-email-text" style="margin:0 auto 16px auto; max-width:480px; font:400 16px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.048px; color:#43454b; text-align:center; word-break:break-word;">Вы получили <b>{amount}</b> кредитов от <a href="{performer_link}">{performer_name}</a>.<br />Ордер: <b>{order}</b>.</p>
<p class="bx-email-text" style="margin:0 auto 0 auto; max-width:480px; font:400 16px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.048px; color:#43454b; text-align:center; word-break:break-word;">{message}</p>
{email_footer}

{email_header}
<h1 class="bx-email-title" style="margin:0 0 20px 0; font:600 28px/1.3 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.084px; color:#14171e; text-align:center;">Здравствуйте, {client_name}</h1>
<p class="bx-email-text" style="margin:0 auto 16px auto; max-width:480px; font:400 16px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.048px; color:#43454b; text-align:center; word-break:break-word;">Вы приобрели <a href="{bundle_url}">{bundle_title}</a> пакет кредитов.<br />Ваш ордер: <b>{order}</b>.</p>
<p class="bx-email-text" style="margin:0 auto 0 auto; max-width:480px; font:400 16px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.048px; color:#43454b; text-align:center; word-break:break-word;">{notes}</p>
{email_footer}

{email_header}
<h1 class="bx-email-title" style="margin:0 0 20px 0; font:600 28px/1.3 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.084px; color:#14171e; text-align:center;">Здравствуйте, {profile_name}</h1>
<p class="bx-email-text" style="margin:0 auto 0 auto; max-width:480px; font:400 16px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.048px; color:#43454b; text-align:center; word-break:break-word;">Вы получили <b>{amount}</b> кредитов от {second_profile_name}.</p>
{email_footer}

{email_header}
<h1 class="bx-email-title" style="margin:0 0 20px 0; font:600 28px/1.3 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.084px; color:#14171e; text-align:center;">Здравствуйте, {profile_name}</h1>
<p class="bx-email-text" style="margin:0 auto 0 auto; max-width:480px; font:400 16px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.048px; color:#43454b; text-align:center; word-break:break-word;">Вы отправили <b>{amount}</b> кредитов на счет {second_profile_name}.</p>
{email_footer}

{email_header}
<p class="bx-email-text" style="margin:0 auto 16px auto; max-width:480px; font:400 16px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.048px; color:#43454b; text-align:center; word-break:break-word;"><a href="{profile_link}">{profile_name}</a> запросил снятие <b>{amount}</b> кредитов с его/её баланса.</p>
<p class="bx-email-text" style="margin:0 auto 16px auto; max-width:480px; font:400 16px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.048px; color:#43454b; text-align:center; word-break:break-word;">Текущий коэффициент вывода: <b>{rate}</b></p>
<p class="bx-email-text" style="margin:0 auto 16px auto; max-width:480px; font:400 16px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.048px; color:#43454b; text-align:center; word-break:break-word;">Подтвердить вывод можно перейдя по <a href="{confirm_url}">ссылке</a>.</p>
<p class="bx-email-text" style="margin:0 auto 0 auto; max-width:480px; font:400 16px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.048px; color:#43454b; text-align:center; word-break:break-word;">Примечания от <b>{profile_name}</b>:<br />{message}</p>
{email_footer}

{email_header}
<p class="bx-email-text" style="margin:0 auto 16px auto; max-width:480px; font:400 16px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.048px; color:#43454b; text-align:center; word-break:break-word;"><a href="{profile_link}">{profile_name}</a> отменил заявку на вывод средств на сумму <b>{amount}</b> кредитов.</p>
<p class="bx-email-text" style="margin:0 auto 0 auto; max-width:480px; font:400 16px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.048px; color:#43454b; text-align:center; word-break:break-word;">Отмененный запрос на вывод средств можно увидеть <a href="{manage_url}">здесь</a>.</p>
{email_footer}

{email_header}
<h1 class="bx-email-title" style="margin:0 0 20px 0; font:600 28px/1.3 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.084px; color:#14171e; text-align:center;">Здравствуйте, {profile_name}</h1>
<p class="bx-email-text" style="margin:0 auto 0 auto; max-width:480px; font:400 16px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.048px; color:#43454b; text-align:center; word-break:break-word;">Запрашиваемая сумма кредитов (<b>{amount}</b>) была отправлена.</p>
{email_footer}
